{"meta":{"ui":"checkout","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"notation","turn":"generate","prompt":"Build a small checkout in three steps: my cart (three items with quantities), a shipping form (name, address, city, postcode, email, all checked, with messages under the fields), then a payment summary with a choice of standard or express delivery changing the total, and a confirmation screen with an order number. I can go back a step without losing what I typed.","text":"state step=1\nstate cart=[{\"id\":\"a\",\"name\":\"Espresso beans, 1 kg\",\"price\":24,\"qty\":1},{\"id\":\"b\",\"name\":\"Milk jug\",\"price\":12,\"qty\":2},{\"id\":\"c\",\"name\":\"Paper filters\",\"price\":5,\"qty\":3}]\nstate subtotal=sum(cart,x=>x.price*x.qty)\nstate name=\"\"\nstate address=\"\"\nstate city=\"\"\nstate postcode=\"\"\nstate email=\"\"\nstate delivery=\"standard\"\nstate shipping=delivery==\"express\"?15:5\nstate total=subtotal+shipping\nstate order=\"JX-\"+string(round(random()*90000+10000,0))\nBox w:390 pad:16 gap:12\n  if step==1\n    Text.title \"Your cart\"\n    each row in cart\n      Row between\n        Column\n          Text.strong \"{row.name}\"\n          Text.muted \"Qty {row.qty}\"\n        Text.strong \"{money(row.price*row.qty,\\\"$\\\",2)}\"\n    Divider\n    Row between\n      Text.heading \"Subtotal\"\n      Text.heading \"{money(subtotal,\\\"$\\\",2)}\"\n    Button \"Continue to shipping\" -> step=2\n  if step==2\n    Text.title \"Shipping\"\n    Input \"Name\" =name\n    Input \"Address\" =address\n    Input \"City\" =city\n    Input \"Postcode\" =postcode\n    Input \"Email\" \"you@example.com\" =email\n    if trim(name)==\"\"\n      Text.danger \"Name is required.\"\n    if trim(address)==\"\"\n      Text.danger \"Address is required.\"\n    if trim(city)==\"\"\n      Text.danger \"City is required.\"\n    if trim(postcode)==\"\"\n      Text.danger \"Postcode is required.\"\n    if !contains(email,\"@\")\n      Text.danger \"Enter a valid email.\"\n    Row gap